    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Cakkhu, bhikkhave, dukkhaṁ atītaṁ anāgataṁ paccuppannaṁ. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, in the past … future … present the eye, ear, nose, tongue, body, and mind are suffering. "
    },
    {
